  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 803.02 Categorization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 803.02 Categorization. Materials that are to be recycled, as defined in Env-Hw 801.02(d), shall be classified as follows:\n\n(a) Materials that are wastes when recycled, as identified in Env-Hw 803.03, and therefore subject to regulation as recyclable materials under Env-Hw 804 through Env-Hw 809; and\n\n(b) Materials that are not wastes when recycled, as identified in Env-Hw 803.04, and therefore not subject to regulation under the hazardous waste rules.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; amd by #10205, eff 10-19-12; ss by #12350, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14526, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
